Dear David,

Your Leave of Absence for Fall 2026 has been approved. Your approval letter i=
s attached; please keep it for your records.

Key points:
- Your enrollment status for Fall 2026 will show as "Leave of Absence". You w=
ill not be registered and will not be charged tuition or fees.
- Time on approved leave does not count toward your time-to-degree limit.
- Your graduate assistantship cannot continue while you are on leave; your de=
partment has set your GRA end date to August 15, 2026.
- To return for Spring 2027, submit a Return from Leave request at least 30 d=
ays before the first day of classes.

Best regards,
Graduate Enrollment Services
The Graduate School | Virginia Tech

